msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.astype"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.astype.astype:1 of
msgid "Cast a LiteFrame to a specified dtype."
msgstr "将 LiteFrame 转换为指定的数据类型。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.astype.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.astype.astype:3 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Use a numpy.dtype or Python type to cast entire LiteFrame to the same "
"type. Alternatively, use {col: dtype, ...}, where col is a column label "
"and dtype is a numpy.dtype or Python type to cast one or more of the "
"DataFrame's columns to column-specific types."
msgstr ""
"使用 numpy.dtype 或 Python 类型将整个 LiteFrame 转换为相同类型。或者，"
"使用 {col: dtype, ...}，其中 col 是列标签，dtype 是 numpy.dtype 或 Python"
" 类型，用于将一个或多个 DataFrame 列转换为特定列类型。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.misc.astype.astype:8 of
msgid ""
"Control raising of exceptions on invalid data for provided dtype.  - "
"``raise`` : allow exceptions to be raised - ``coerce`` : uncastable "
"values become null and the output dtype   changes to the target type.  "
"``'ignore'`` is not supported by LiteFrame astype; use ``'coerce'`` for "
"null-on-failure semantics."
msgstr ""
"控制对提供的数据类型无效数据引发异常的操作。- ``raise``：允许引发异常 - `"
"`coerce``：不可转换的值变为null，输出数据类型更改为目标类型。LiteFrame "
"astype不支持``'ignore'``；使用``'coerce'``来实现失败时为null的语义。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.astype.rst
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

